# Choices and labels
@scenario tutorial_lesson_10
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char ginger global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: I found an envelope under the studio door. Shall we open it now, or save it for later?
> Open the envelope -> read_note
> Leave it on the table -> leave_note
@label read_note
[show ginger guide embarrassed]
ginger: It's our rehearsal schedule. We were supposed to start ten minutes ago!
[jump compare]
@label leave_note
[show ginger guide thoughtful]
ginger: I'll put it beside the bell. Whoever comes in next will see it.
[jump compare]
@label compare
ginger: We both ended up here, but you only heard the reply you chose. Both labels jump back to this line.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
ginger: What does the arrow after a choice point to?
> A sprite expression. -> retry
> A destination label. -> correct
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: Each branch can perform different work before both paths meet. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: Each branch can perform different work before both paths meet.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_10]
[flag tutorial_done_10]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_1]
